<title>NORWAY: Kvaerner wins 280 mln crown Ghana deal.</title>
<headline>Kvaerner wins 280 mln crown Ghana deal.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kvaerner Construction in Britain has won a contract for the construction of a hospital in Ghana worth about 280 million crowns, the Norwegian industry conglomerate said in a statement to the Oslo Bourse on Monday.</p>
<p>No further details were given.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
